WEBVTT

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:05.070
Jiao Dan Ji!

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:10.140
Solitary Wave!

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.550
Whirling Death Strike!

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.510
Goldion Hammer!

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.350
Za Powa, maximum output!

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.600
The Ultimate Brave Warrior Brigade has unleashed an all-out attack...

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.730
...and the Z-Master has finally gone down in defeat.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:42.450
The entire universe has been saved.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:49.750
Now I know!

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:52.580
How I'm really supposed to use the G-Stone...

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:54.920
Two powers become one...

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:01.860
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo...

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.790
Vitas!

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:11.870
We've won.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:16.800
It was Cain and Za Powa that helped us to win.

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:19.210
And...

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.550
...thanks to you too, Dad, Mom...

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:31.550
Za Powa was a force that neither GGG nor the Primevals could control.

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:35.990
We won't be using that energy ever again.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.330
Farewell, Jupiter...

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:42.900
Farewell, J-Jewel warriors...

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:46.280
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:49.180
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.880
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:56.550 --> 00:02:00.800
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:07.030
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:11.120
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:15.820
to save the future of outer space.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:19.780
It's time to launch!

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:22.960
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:26.880
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:31.580
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:34.540
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:37.460
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:40.210
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:43.720
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:47.390
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:54.920
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:55.120 --> 00:03:00.920
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:03.740
Our very own King of Braves!

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:07.920
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:11.790
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:14.910
Life

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.040
<i>Life</i>

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.840
So you're back with me, Mikoto?

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.140
I...

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.980
I guess you had a lot of exhaustion building up inside.

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.230
I'm going to show you something you'll really like.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:59.970
Waha! We're going to see everybody on Earth soon!

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:09.550
We're almost home, eh?

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.650
It was a long journey, wasn't it?

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:14.860
First, I'd like to take a hot shower, and drink some ice-cold Hoppy!

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:18.420
Never mind that! I want to eat as much white rice as I can take!

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:22.200
I'm gonna ask my mom to make Tropical Burgers!

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:24.970
Oh! I'd love to try some, too!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:27.300
Sure! You're gonna help make them, right?

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:30.600
Oh, but I'm a terrible cook!

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:36.770
Ladies and gentlemen, your attention, please!

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:40.010
Earth's Defense Organization, the Gutsy Galaxy Guard...

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:44.450
...otherwise known as GGG, has just made their triumphant return.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:49.020
They have thwarted the attempt by the Zonderians to invade Earth...

00:04:49.090 --> 00:04:54.260
...and have also defeated the terrifying 31 Machine Primevals...

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.730
...from far off in the galaxy, on Jupiter.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:00.600
GGG's infinite courage and unwavering sense of responsibility...

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:03.500
...deserve our most heartfelt applause!

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:06.000
Welcome home, GGG!

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:08.200
Thank you, GGG!

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:16.310
Goodbye, my friend!

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:38.800
Welcome home, Mamoru.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:41.270
I'm home...

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:42.570
Dad...

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:43.710
Mom...

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:46.980
Waha!

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:48.210
Waha!

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:49.410
Mamoru!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.050
Welcome home!

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:52.210
I'm home!

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.190
Welcome home!

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:54.620
I'm home!

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:56.320
Welcome home!

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:58.310
I'm home! I'm home!

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:58.790
Welcome home!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.150
Oh, no!

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:24.680
But I wanted to play with Mamoru! So no thank you to the overhaul!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.920
Right, that's right. Absolutely!

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:28.920
No, you're wrong about that, RaiRyu.

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:33.030
Precisely. We must ensure that we're in optimum condition at all times.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.390
That's what being a true hero is about.

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:37.160
Hey, I knew that!

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.030
Me too, you know!

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:42.030
Anyway, we all kicked some butt, didn't we?

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:44.940
Yes. It was a series of grueling battles, one after the other.

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:47.010
Hate to say it myself, but we were pretty impressive!

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:53.520
Chest Warmer!

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:57.120
Ul-Tech Rifle!

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:03.550
Two of the Four Machine Kings, Primarda and Polonaise...

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.710
Those two were pretty darn formidable!

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:21.640
And I went into battle numerous times against...

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.080
...another of the Four Machine Kings, Penchinon.

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:33.450
If I remember right...

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:36.960
...he's the one who was reborn as the J-Ark's super-computer.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.890
Yes. He was an invaluable friend to me.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:44.070
Hey! I hope you haven't forgotten all the things I did!

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:49.810
System Change!

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.220
Mic Sounders!

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:15.320
My brothers who went to Heaven... I hope they've found peace now!

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:18.930
Shuang Tou Long!

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:32.870
We learned something during that battle.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:37.540
That our top priority is the preservation of human life...

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:40.990
And who taught us that? Big Brother HyoRyu and...

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:43.390
...Big Brother EnRyu.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:47.820
And thanks to our powerful mutual trust we were finally able to...

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:50.830
...achieve Symmetrical Docking on an unbelievable scale!

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:54.740
Maximum Tou Long!

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:58.440
Yeah, yeah, you can go on and on about it...

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:01.840
...but who delivers the final blow to the enemy? Me, of course!

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:10.850
So I guess that makes me the ultimate robot, huh?

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:17.930
Oh, but that's all because of GaoGaiGar, you know!

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:19.750
Huh? What did you say?

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:22.360
Hey, all I said was the truth, you know!

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:24.330
You looking for a fight?

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:27.730
Call now, and I'll give you a 30% off discount!

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:31.640
You little... Come on, we're going one-on-one, you Yankee rust bucket!

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:34.470
Oh sure, I'll take you on anytime, you brainless klutz!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:37.980
What the... Listen, the problem with you is your personality!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:41.610
I might say the same of you, you know!

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:51.620
You forgot these, so I brought them here for you.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:55.120
But really, how could you pass away before me?

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:57.060
Just couldn't wait, could you?

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:01.630
Dad...

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:02.900
Mom...

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:06.960
Shishioh
Family
Grave

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.430
One of these days...

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:07.410
...I'll go to Jupiter again to see you.

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:13.820
Now then, why don't we all go for sushi?

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:16.880
Excuse me, but I think I'll stop by my parents' graves.

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:18.580
Right, I'll go with you.

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:20.150
Hey, me too, then!

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:23.030
You're so clueless, you know that?

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.390
Let them be by themselves.

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:26.490
Darn!

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:34.530
It's been 3 years already, huh?

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:36.110
Yeah.

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:59.350
Mother, Father!

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.370
Mother, Father!

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:15.510
Is... is someone there?

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:19.080
O, you weak-willed souls...

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:22.250
What?

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:27.050
I can't go on...

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:28.910
I can't move!

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:31.260
Gai!

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:36.990
But the nightmare's over now. This time for sure.

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:46.470
Oh! It's a shooting star!

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:48.780
That's the Galeoria comet.

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:52.310
I think it's been 8 years now since the last time it came near Earth.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.680
Hey, I just remembered.

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:54.380
Huh?

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:57.220
Your dream of becoming an astronaut...

00:11:57.290 --> 00:12:00.690
...you told me about it while we were watching that comet right here.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:04.390
Come to think of it, you gave this to me on the day of the exam.

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:05.530
This pendant...

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:12.440
Thanks to this good luck charm, I managed to survive until now.

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:15.230
No, I'm the one who should be thankful.

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:19.440
...it's because you came back, Gai, that I found the courage to live again!

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:23.270
Oh, wait!

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:27.080
I was going to wait until after you defeated the aliens...

00:12:27.150 --> 00:12:29.620
...so nothing should stop me from giving this to you now.

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:32.780
I kept it hidden away for years.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:36.550
My feelings for you written in this letter, even now...

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:40.090
No, I mean now and forever, they'll never change!

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:45.400
Thank you.

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:50.240
Gai...

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:51.470
Huh?

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:55.170
Would it be all right if I stayed by your side from now on?

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:59.570
Because I don't have a place to call home anymore.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:01.910
Mikoto...

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:10.220
Mikoto?

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.190
Mikoto!

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:16.000
Mikoto!

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:35.280
They said there's nothing really wrong with you.

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:37.410
I guess you were just exhausted.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.580
All this time, I've made you go through so much, Mikoto...

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:43.520
I'm sorry, Gai.

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:47.930
Gai, your hand is so warm.

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:49.920
But you know my hand is...

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:51.090
No...

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.760
I can feel it, you see.

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:56.400
The warmest thing in the whole universe.

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:10.580
We had a lot of fun, didn't we? At the Waterpolis!

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:16.260
I hope we can all go again one day!

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.990
Why don't we go someplace during spring break?

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:22.790
Good idea! Since there won't be any Zonders popping up anymore!

00:14:23.770 --> 00:14:24.760
You're right!

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:28.970
Even if a Zonder does show up, GaoGaiGar will take care of him for us!

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.270
That time we went to the hot spring at Hakone...

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:36.570
...a Zonder got in the way again, remember?

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.910
Zonder!

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:54.190
Mom and Dad... I'm not really your kid, am I?

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.120
Mamoru...

00:14:58.200 --> 00:14:59.730
My little Mamoru!

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:05.470
There's no question that you're our child!

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:07.370
That's right!

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:11.140
It's just that the way you came to us was a little different than other kids!

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:12.940
Right...

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:19.590
Dad... Mom...

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:20.880
What is it?

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:23.020
Thanks.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:33.830
Okay, I'm going to bed now! 'Cause I have a field trip tomorrow!

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:38.340
Oh, I forgot! Good night!

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:40.310
Good night!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:47.150
Mamoru's certainly grown up, hasn't he?

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:48.580
Oh, yes!

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:50.550
He's a son to be proud of!

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:53.490
Our little Mamoru...

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:04.160
What's this?

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:06.790
I'm getting a bad feeling.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.560
Maybe I'm imagining things?

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:13.340
All right, class, you're free to look around on your own now!

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.500
Okay!

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:22.710
We're gonna be in the fourth grade soon, huh?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:25.350
I hope we'll end up in the same class again!

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:27.850
That whole year went by so fast, didn't it?

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.220
You're right, it's already been a year since that day, huh?

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:39.760
I really thought we were goners that day!

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:43.030
I'd like to see him one more time, that GaoGaiGar!

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:46.300
Me too! I want to see my Super-cool Dreamboat again!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:04.990
Hey, you guys! Just look at this!

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.360
See how many buildings are already back up?

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:11.200
Pretty hard to believe, huh?

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:14.000
That Tokyo got swallowed up whole just a little while ago!

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:17.730
Oh, yeah! I didn't know how we were gonna make it that day, either!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:21.000
Yeah, but we did manage to survive, thanks to GGG!

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:25.110
Oh, my Super-cool Dreamboat was absolutely awesome, wasn't he?

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:32.580
Come to think of it...

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:36.790
We haven't seen Ikumi since he disappeared that day.

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:38.490
Right.

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:40.790
Thank you...

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:42.930
My friend from Earth...

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:54.770
Mother...

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:02.010
Mamoru?

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:06.480
Don't you go anywhere, okay, Mamoru?

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:09.520
That promise, you remember it, don't you?

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:11.620
Uh, sure!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:19.300
Tell me, do you two believe in God?

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:21.840
No, dummy! They're exchanging vows, see?

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:22.840
Oops, sorry.

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:27.080
Mamoru, it's a lot of trouble, so you might as well just get hitched now!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:27.940
Hey, hold up!

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.410
Hey, hold up! That's right! The earlier the better!

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:32.740
Come on, you guys, hold on a second!

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:37.220
What's that?

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:42.420
Mikoto!

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:52.390
This energy...

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:06.650
Mikoto...

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:19.600
Zonuda...

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:23.590
Ms. Utsugi!

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:28.900
Impossible! We destroyed all 31 of the Primevals, didn't we?

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:30.910
Then is it a Zonder?

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:33.740
No, now that the Z-Master has been annihilated...

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:36.750
...there's no way that Zonders or Zonderians could be on the move.

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:37.980
Then what in the world...

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:39.780
Oh! This is terrible!

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:47.250
As Mikoto advances, the energy levels on the Orbit Base keep dropping!

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:51.820
Both the Main and Secondary Power Reactors are running below 25%!

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.120
At this rate...

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.560
What's Ms. Utsugi's current location?

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:57.560
She's moving through the 13th level!

00:19:57.930 --> 00:19:59.200
Headed for...

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:00.830
Amaterasu!

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:03.600
I can't move...

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:05.270
...my body!

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:08.170
Zonuda!

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:17.980
Power efficiency...

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:21.120
13 percent...

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.590
Mikoto!

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.200
If I'm going to save everyone...

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:41.140
...this is the only thing I can do!

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:48.650
Forgive me...

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:52.650
What the...

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:54.210
Did she just separate?

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:02.660
Zonuda...

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:06.860
No! Amaterasu!

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:09.030
Is she manipulating it now?

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:10.870
It's falling towards Earth!

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:12.770
Don't tell me her objective is...

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:14.810
Mechanization of the Earth?

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:21.880
Something's coming!

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:32.590
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:52.520
Zonuda...

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:58.080
It's not a Zonder and it's not a Primeval. Just what is that thing?

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:11.260
Hey! It's headed this way!

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:12.930
This is bad! Let's get out of here!

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:21.100
What should I do?

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:26.240
No, don't come!

00:22:26.320 --> 00:22:27.370
Galeon!

00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:37.390
No, stop!

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:38.960
Stop!

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:41.500
Galeon!

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:48.350
Now releasing the final intelligence report.

00:23:48.430 --> 00:23:51.660
All substances have been sublimated by the New Machine Species...

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:53.330
...as well as the destiny of all living things.

00:23:53.400 --> 00:23:54.500
Farewell, Mikoto!

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:55.540
Farewell, Gai!

00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:56.770
Farewell, Mamoru!

00:23:57.010 --> 00:23:59.340
This burning saga of a battle fought for the sake of...

00:23:59.410 --> 00:24:01.500
...mankind's survival, is now about to end.

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:03.980
GaoGaiGar, King of Braves, Final Episode...

00:24:04.050 --> 00:24:05.640
"Someday in the Sea of Stars"

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:10.020
Stay tuned to see the ultimate Final Fusion of the century approved!

00:24:06.310 --> 00:24:06.350
Someday in the Sea of Stars

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:15.050
Guy Shishioh

00:24:12.860 --> 00:24:14.490
This is the Key to Victory!
